  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening grassroots CSOs in South Ethiopia to protect civic space and promote citizens engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is part of the EU CSF Plus Programme titled &#x201c;Strengthening the Capacities of Grassroots CSOs in Ethiopia.&#x201d; It aims to empower local CSOs to protect civic space through strengthening their capacities, creation of enabling environment and fostering their coordinated engagement.
&#xb7;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; To strengthen institutional capacity of 12 local CSOs to become viable entities delivering their organizational objectives effectively by the end of project period.
&#xb7;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; To Increase awareness of CSO legislation among key government bodies and 12 CSOs to ensure effective implementation that protects civic space by the end of the project period.
&#xb7;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0; To enhance understanding and practical skills of 12 local CSOs in governance, policy dialogue, democracy, and human rights by the end of the project period.</narrative>
  </description>
